# From "Planning Center" (Wave VIII - Union, CD3-5): the collective,
# Earth-scale counterpart to meeting-with-the-entry-director.gws's personal
# focus -- this planning center's role for the whole system, not your own
# entry into it.

@segment  planning-center
@title    The Planning Center
@levels   F27
@duration ~5m

say Move your intention to the Planning Center -- the place that oversees energy patterns in the Earth life system: introducing new ones, removing ones no longer useful, modifying others.
pause 8
say Observe. Ask to understand how new ideas and energy patterns get introduced into physical earth reality. Open your perception, and watch.
pause 10
say Now become part of the process. Ask to be given an idea here you can track, follow, or help bring into the physical -- a concept, an invention, a fragrance, an event, a musical theme, a scientific insight, a personal integration. Whatever comes, follow its course from Focus 27 into the Earth's energy pattern.
pause 12
say Now ask to observe another function here -- the uplink, monitoring everything that flows back from human earth consciousness, feeding into the record and into what happens next. Watch the streams of information return. Notice how they're received, considered, recorded.
pause 12
say With both directions in view -- what flows out to Earth, and what flows back -- ask what you can perceive about the larger plan. What's the grand design for how the planet continues to unfold?
hold 60
say Give thanks for what you've learned. Make the intention to remember it.
pause 6
